      "created_at": "2022-06-22T12:18:47.721Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Haka, Void Guard: Writhe, Santa Guise (???), The Southwest Sentinels, and Stuntman take on Oblivaeon with Borr’s shield (The Effusion of Pain) in the Realm of Discord and Omnitron IV. If I recall correctly, MMFCC and Nexus of the Void were two of the other environments, but I can’t recall the 5th.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4hXxjA1PPd1TWOScFcQgiOy9Ehc\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2_2_230x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1e106f876523acfe0474a5cfc9971be746e207e2_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">291×630 64.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>This team was actually pretty decent for flipping the shield. I ended up getting Mr. Fixer set up with Dual Crowbars and the Mecha-Knight Ultra-Strike, so gave him every incap power I had. Turns out Mr. Fixer can thrive off hitting his own teammates if there aren’t enough Scions around.</p>",
